menu "Environment Logger"

config EL_BRINGUP
    bool "Bring-up build (diagnostic boot)"
    default n
    help
        First power-up of a new board: boots into DIAG mode (board, storage, USB console only),
        nothing runs automatically. Never ship with this enabled.

config EL_FIXTURE_DETECT
    bool "Factory boot when the loopback plug is detected (DI1 active at power-up)"
    default n
    help
        Boots into the FACTORY self-test mode when DI1 is active at power-up (loopback fixture,
        docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md). Off by default: DI1 may be wired to something else.

endmenu
